NativeForwardModule
├── executeNative
│   ├── when amount is zero
│   │   └── it should revert with NativeForwardModule_ValueMismatch
│   ├── when value differs from amount
│   │   └── it should revert with NativeForwardModule_ValueMismatch
│   ├── when recipient is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert with NativeForwardModule_ZeroRecipient
│   ├── when amount is below minAmount
│   │   └── it should revert with NativeForwardModule_AmountBelowMinimum
│   ├── when recipient refuses the value
│   │   └── it should revert with NativeForwardModule_TransferFailed
│   ├── when recipient accepts
│   │   ├── it should transfer the value to the recipient
│   │   ├── it should return success with the native sentinel as outputToken
│   │   ├── it should return the encoded recipient in data
│   │   ├── it should hold nothing afterwards
│   │   └── it should emit NativeForwarded
│   ├── when recipient is a contract
│   │   └── it should deliver the value
│   └── fuzz
│       └── when amount is at or above minAmount
│           └── it should deliver exactly amount
├── execute
│   └── it should return a failed result with "Native input only"
├── validate
│   ├── when token is not the native sentinel
│   │   ├── it should return false with "Native input only"
│   │   └── it should not revert on malformed params
│   ├── when amount is zero
│   │   └── it should return false with "Zero amount"
│   ├── when recipient is zero address
│   │   └── it should return false with "Zero recipient address"
│   ├── when amount is below minAmount
│   │   └── it should return false with "Amount below minimum"
│   ├── when caller native balance is insufficient
│   │   └── it should return false with "Insufficient balance"
│   └── when all checks pass
│       └── it should return true with empty reason
├── estimateOutput
│   └── it should return amount and the native sentinel
├── moduleType
│   ├── it should return "NATIVE_FORWARD"
│   └── it should report native input support
└── encodeDecodeParams
    ├── it should roundtrip recipient and minAmount
    ├── it should revert on empty bytes
    └── it should roundtrip any values [fuzz]
